  cardRows:
  - TIME CARD
  - EMP. NO. 0417
  - WEEK OF 10/14/02
  - DAY   IN     OUT
  - MON  8:58A  6:34P
  - TUE  9:03A  6:31P
  - WED  8:55A  6:40P
  - THU  9:01A  6:29P
  - FRI  9:04A
  cardStamp: OUT 6:30 PM
  noticeTitle: NOTICE TO VACATE
  noticeBody: 'Date: October 18, 2002

    To: All Occupants, Unit 1B


    You are hereby notified that your tenancy at this address is TERMINATED. You must vacate the premises within THIRTY (30) DAYS of this notice.


    This property has been acquired for redevelopment. Through a community partnership program, new housing has been arranged for your household at NO COST to you.


    A representative will contact you with your new address. Please do not contact the leasing office.


    We thank you for your cooperation.

    - Property Management'
  credits: 'EVICTION

    A PSX Horror Concept Demo


    CREATED BY

    SOULWXRTH

    Austinn.vfx


    STORY & DESIGN

    SOULWXRTH & Austinn.vfx


    MUSIC

    SOULWXRTH


    3D MODELS

    Office Pack by nappin

    Simple Retro Car by Polyeler

    Low Poly Cars by AWBMECREATIONS

    Residential Building by Carthage Studio

    Demo City by Versatile Studio


    SOUND EFFECTS (PIXABAY)

    freesound_community

    universfield

    hookedmedia

    dragon-studio

    musicnation782

    matthewvakaliuk73627

    rubyland1

    soundsforstory


    MADE WITH UNITY'
  thankYou: 'THANK YOU FOR PLAYING


    This is our first small look at EVICTION.

    Thank you for taking the time to play it.

    It means more than you know.


    More soon.

    - SOULWXRTH & Austinn.vfx'
